<title>FINLAND: FINNISH PM LIPPONEN POSTPONES MOSCOW VISIT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH PM LIPPONEN POSTPONES MOSCOW VISIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Prime Minister Paavo Lipponen has postponed a planned visit to Moscow by a couple of weeks, a government spokeswoman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Lipponen had been due to meet his Russian counterpart Viktor Chernomyrdin on April 28-29, but Chernomyrdin's office said the Russian Prime Minister was going to Slovakia on those dates.</p>
<p>The Finnish STT radio news said Lipponen was now likely to go to Moscow in mid-May.</p>
